    "paragraph": "This study establishes a conceptual framework for defining and measuring user engagement with open-data-based geovisualizations. Another empirical map study evaluated how narrative structure affects user engagement, performance, and trust by testing 135 participants recruited via Prolific. Finally, a new publication presents the updated printed edition of Part VI of the National Atlas of Spain, focusing on social services and facilities across three thematic chapters.",
